Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,终于能跟你对话了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这次通话不会被监听
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还不能说?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要{\fsp8}去{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}城吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这城市被多层保卫系统守护着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只凭你一人无法绕过系统入侵进去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会相信你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,洞悉对手 隐藏自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,方为忍者之神妙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 忍者的诗…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.69,0:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你我立场一致
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,叛忍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.81,0:00:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你想得偿所愿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就来之后发给你的地点 等我指示
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,信不信由你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不接吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是我老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我想集中精力在搜查上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可现在还不清楚目击情报是否准确
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,说是疲劳驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在给你打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我本以为自己很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,成为搜查官的家属意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.71,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,身体还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我心跳差点停了 你这臭烤鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来帮忙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的和你一样是叛忍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道自古以来流传在组织里的诗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来到这国家之后再没人唱过这诗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,仅凭这个就相信他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但那人说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}城的保卫系统相当棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,或许只有幽灵才能入侵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果这是个陷阱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉就行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别说得那么直白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是暂时休战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们怎么进城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,分局长都那样了 或许我已经被盯上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定被盯上了 放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你不也说过要想抓住他们的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就得直捣他们总部大楼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,行不行得通是另一码事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但肯定有方法…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我抓到了其他线索
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,暗网上有个讨{\fsp8}论{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的群组
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}说{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}企图征服世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在制造不得了的杀戮武器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一般的黑子一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这点事也拿到暗网上聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,也算安全起见?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我找出了一位自称{\fsp8}前{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}研究员的管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他住得挺远
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你调查到这里就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事就该由我这种上了年纪一无所有的人来干
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这种好事岂能让你独占
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这次能接近{\fsp8}那{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的秘密了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,顺利的话 能拿到最先进的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,卖了能赚几万
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 少说也能卖几十万美元
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你这人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样 再次请多关照啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能问你一件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你去世的老婆知道你真实身份吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道 因为她也是忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者也能成家?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们打破戒律了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,戒律?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,同伴之间 亦不得生情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你选择了家人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的很强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那量产型有能消灭别国一个排军队的数据记录
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,却完全无法与他匹敌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.47,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 你也按捺不住想和他交手了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我跟你这下流货色不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个实业家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,自己不战斗 想要的也不是胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而是数据
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他现身了怎么办 撅屁股给人踢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这就需要优秀的秘书出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 迪莉 他用了什么手段把你驯化成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,社长 我能向这堕落混蛋详述您的手段吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧 还有注意你的措辞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那怎么办 他总会来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.97,0:07:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 城市的铁{\fsp8}壁{\r}100{\fsp8}%{\r}不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:08:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着慢着 阿斯卡 不要轻易{\fsp8}用{\r}100{\fsp8}%{\r}这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,概率这东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}大{\r}D 你在听吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我的发型收拾得比平时都好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,敢把我发型弄乱 就宰了他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是哪个部位的头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,废话到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来就知道彼岸实力之强
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,方案不变
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,先得摸清他的奥义是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他一起的搜查官呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.95,0:08:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,量他什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他搞事了再收拾他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别做多余的事 自找麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你又不是我老板 别命令我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但我同意你的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉啊 你觉得那个忍者能撑到哪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,您担心他?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是期待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我为什么和你们联手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,终于能取得测试型的数据了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别死太快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只要您下令 我立马收拾他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.91,0:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你按兵不动 我让他们先上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他展露奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,出现牺牲也不算损失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,说白了 这段关系只会维持到那东西完成
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们由戒律联结
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,受戒律保护
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因戒律而生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 我们为戒律而死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为戒律而死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,其一 绝不泄露忍者之秘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不泄露忍者之秘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,其二 同伴之间亦不得生情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,同伴之间亦不得生情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,其三 性命为轻任务为重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,性命为轻任务为重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等… 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,此次认可诸位为优秀的忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,授予诸位忍名
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,以后可如此自称
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,授予诸位的不只忍名
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还有奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,奥义如同诸位的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,决不可告诉他人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,以后的任务会更加危险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.89,0:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但诸位在忍者中也有着出类拔萃的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,相信诸位有朝一日能引导我们村
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有了忍名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大家名字都不错 我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是习惯不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,名字是存在的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就不会忘记彼此了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这次就当真庆祝一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别把奥义给说漏了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定有一天会刀剑相向
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得和你们的联系浓于血
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,说不准我们何时丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一起活过的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是一起交谈过的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也是盟约的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,盟约?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一起赌上性命 完成使命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不用管我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去 任务会失败
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法一人回去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要谨遵戒律 同伴之间亦不得生情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,遇见你的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我就打破戒律了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听到信号音后请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是烤鸭吗 你要什么时候才肯接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我正赶往情报源那边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,之后联系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,出院了怎么不汇报
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么顺风耳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,礼物放桌上就行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我退休那天来拿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有案件在身 想干嘛干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.84,0:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但你又不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.45,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么对不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,听上司的命令不是理所当然吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 我一直在琢磨怎么丢下你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈 饿不饿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,日本有句谚语 空着肚子没法打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,明智的判断
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别急
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,首先得让你理解城市的警卫系统
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,整{\fsp8}个{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}城受其自研的保卫系统守护
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,城市周边设有扫描传感器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,检查来者是否事先获得过进城许可
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有不速之客不听警告的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,系统会攻击他们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 城市上空覆盖着蜂窝状电子屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只有风雨才能进
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,从地面上入侵是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你从管理传感器的部门所使用的地下设施走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,之后把入口位置和内部地图发给你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,设施内不仅有监控 激光陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还有民间军事公司的雇佣兵把守各个区段
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:18:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不妨碍此次作战 你要避免一切战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当你到达尽头的电子屏障时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我会切断电源五秒 打开屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,再长就不能伪装成故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,傍晚时行动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,机会只有一次 只有五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,吃饱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样随时都能上战场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 给你发他的正面照
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森·卡德纳斯 希望他没啥改变
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.13,0:18:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就算变了我也能认出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 怎么认
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,下次教你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来 我们还是第一次分开搜查吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好好干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈也多注意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我好歹算是受过你的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,突然说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,又来?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你会咖啡因中毒的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,从刚才起你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得我像是要死了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你死了的话我就伤脑筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟还想受你指导呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今后也请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我换成水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我黑掉了里面的监控
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,能撑八分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,趁这段时间穿过设施吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的巡逻路线和检查区域安排周密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,照我指示行动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去斜对面的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,激光陷阱每两秒变换方向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.97,0:20:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这次只能靠你的身体机能了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有入侵者 {\fsp8}在D{\r}区 {\fsp8}在D{\r}区
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别停
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:20:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,前面的通道就是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我来切断电源 打开屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只有五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Comment: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:46.27,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(436,0)\an5\c&H2D2B21&\pos(1493.4,101.4)\frz341.8}我爱爸爸 因为他保护大家免受坏人所害
Comment: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:45.20,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:50.54,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:55.79,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:22:00.55,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:08.22,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:13.14,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.73,0:22:17.69,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.69,0:22:22.90,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:28.20,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:33.33,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:38.67,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:43.34,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:46.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,5,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:45.20,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:50.54,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:55.79,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:22:00.55,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:08.22,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:13.14,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.73,0:22:17.69,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.69,0:22:22.90,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:28.20,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:33.33,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:38.67,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:43.34,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:46.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
